00:13:55.649 --> 00:14:03.279
They gave relief to me sadly for short time.

00:14:03.279 --> 00:14:07.769
Um, but, but real relief for a time.

00:14:07.769 --> 00:14:12.509
But that menu needs to include many more things.

00:14:12.509 --> 00:14:13.720
There's overwhelming evidence.

00:14:13.720 --> 00:14:17.350
This isn't my view, this isn't some cranky
view.

00:14:17.350 --> 00:14:27.670
The World Health Organization, the leading
medical body in

00:14:27.670 --> 00:14:33.779
the world has been warning us the years that
this overly biological model is damaging people's

00:14:33.779 --> 00:14:34.779
health.

00:14:34.779 --> 00:14:36.260
It tells them that pain doesn't mean anything.

00:14:36.260 --> 00:14:50.369
If you're praying, if your story is that it's
in your biology, then that says to people

00:14:50.369 --> 00:14:57.769
that you just feel this way cause it's like
a glitch.

00:14:57.769 --> 00:15:00.239
But that's not true.

00:15:00.239 --> 00:15:08.290
There are biological contributions, but we
feel this way for reasons.

00:15:08.290 --> 00:15:20.139
Those reasons are understandable when they're
explained to people.

00:15:20.139 --> 00:15:25.129
It's not like rocket science.

00:15:25.129 --> 00:15:30.730
I think, for example, that list I just gave,
which is a obviously a partial list, I think

00:15:30.730 --> 00:15:35.079
everyone listening would have nodded and gone,
well, of course, if you're lonely, if you're

00:15:35.079 --> 00:15:44.790
taught that life is all about money.

00:15:44.790 --> 00:15:55.620
If you've had a really traumatic childhood,
if you're controlled and humiliated at work,

00:15:55.620 --> 00:16:09.439
you're going to be more likely to become depressed
and dealing with those problems together as

00:16:09.439 --> 00:16:12.220
a culture will reduce depression and anxiety.

00:16:12.220 --> 00:17:30.540
We need to restore to people a sense that

00:17:30.540 --> 00:20:12.870
your

00:20:12.870 --> 00:20:56.950
pain

00:20:56.950 --> 00:20:58.700
makes sense.

00:20:58.700 --> 00:21:03.860
We feel this way for reasons and together
we can deal with those reasons.

00:21:03.860 --> 00:21:08.190
And one of the reasons I was really inspired
in the journey I did them a bit lost connections

00:21:08.190 --> 00:21:14.370
is because all over the world from San Francisco
to Sydney to Sao Paolo, I saw people who were

00:21:14.370 --> 00:21:19.750
doing that, who were understanding the deeper
causes of depression and we're fixing them

00:21:19.750 --> 00:21:20.750
together.

00:21:20.750 --> 00:21:27.350
But to do that, the very first thing we have
to do is we have to stop insulting these signals

00:21:27.350 --> 00:21:33.870
by saying that a sign of weakness or a sign
of craziness or purely a biological malfunction,

00:21:33.870 --> 00:21:39.650
and we need to start listening to these signals
because they are telling us something we really

00:21:39.650 --> 00:21:46.341
need to hear and it's only when we honor these
signals and respect these signals that we

00:21:46.341 --> 00:21:52.660
can begin to see the deliberating nourishing
deeper solutions.

00:21:52.660 --> 00:21:56.810
The cows that are waiting all around us,

00:21:56.810 --> 00:22:00.700
we've been speaking with Johann Hari who is
of course the author of the book lost connections

00:22:00.700 --> 00:22:02.271
on covering the real causes of disease,

00:22:02.271 --> 00:22:05.180
depression and the unexpected solutions.

